  "title": "India's Participation in Commonwealth Games 2026 and Rural Road Construction",
  "summary": "India will participate in the Commonwealth Games 2026, with athletes representing various sports and disciplines. The event highlights India's growing role in global sporting events and its focus on national pride. A Punjab man was charged Rs 100 extra for a T-shirt on the MRP, but the man won Rs 8,000 from a compensation payout. The Centre has allocated ₹1,000 crore under the Pradhan Mantri Gram Sadak Yojana for rural roads, aiming to improve connectivity.",
